!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Now put in some description
!|!
!|k00
!|c08
!|=00000001
!|c0F
!|!
!|c0B
!|k00
!|!
!|fZKQO
!|y0000B00a040000001a1a000000Dixon
!|!
!|@K0CIThis object is a single RIPscrip
!|@K0DOcommand.  It is called a poly-
!|@K0EUpolygon, composed of multiple 
!|@K0G0polygons all of which are drawn 
!|@K0H6at the same time.  The "holes" 
!|@K0ICyou see in this object cannot be 
!|@K0JKachieved with multiple polygon 
!|@K0KPcommands.  This is useful for 
!|@K0LUcreating polygon style objects 
!|@K0MZwith holes in them to achieve a 
!|@K0O4particular effect.
!|!
!|fHR9S
!|!
!|fZKQO
!|1bVU0QYY1S0000000000back.bmp
!|1M00VT0QYY1R1000000<<if $RETURN$!="">>$<<RETURN>>$<<else>>$NULL$<<endif>>
